title: The diff inside the card of steps.rs: on, split, unfold, together, around 0, around 50, off; after off the card is the plain file with its own line numbers and no removed line left
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: let two = 2;\n    two\n[\s\S]*eleven\(\)
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
wait 500
mark 0-plain
wait 500
diff on
wait 1200
mark 1-on
wait 500
diff split
wait 1200
mark 2-split
wait 500
diff unfold
wait 1200
mark 3-split-unfold
wait 500
diff together
wait 1200
mark 4-unfold
wait 500
diff fold
diff around 0
wait 1200
mark 5-around-0
wait 500
diff around 50
wait 1200
mark 6-around-50
wait 500
diff off
wait 1200
mark 7-off
wait 500
quit
